<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 1.8 pct in Nov 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 1.8 pct in Nov 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 1.8 percent in the November 1-10 period after rising 0.1 percent in the previous 10 days and were 2.0 percent higher than in the October 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				    NOV 1-10   OCT 21-30  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	1.8	   0.1	  2.0 (0.3)</p>
<p> Bread				0.9	   1.0	  2.2 (2.4)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  18.5	  -0.5	 16.1(-9.7)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.4	  -0.4	 -0.7 (0.4)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.4	   0.3	  1.1 (1.0)</p>
<p> Eggs				 1.5	   0.9	  4.4 (5.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on October 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
